= Design Archive

本目录保存已退休的旧设计。当前为空：所有现行设计都在 `language/`、`world/` 与 `host/` 下，历史版本由 Git 保存。

== 旧编号映射

本次无编号重构前的 D 编号对应如下，便于阅读旧提交与历史讨论：

```text
D0001  → designs/overview
D0011  → designs/language/shaping-structure-tree
D0012  → designs/language/scope-environment
D0013  → designs/language/evaluation-model
D0014  → designs/language/collection-types
D0015  → designs/language/call-model
D0016  → designs/language/type-system
D0017  → designs/language/property-table
D0018  → designs/language/annotation-syntax
D0019  → designs/world/boundary-discovery
D0020  → designs/world/module-result
D0021  → designs/world/import
D0022  → designs/world/reference-ref-target
D0023  → designs/host/query-contract
D0024  → designs/host/cli-command-surface-skill-distribution
D0025  → designs/host/analyzer-snapshot
D0026  → designs/host/lsp-adapter
D0027  → designs/host/html-renderer
D0028  → designs/host/build-preview
D0029  → designs/world/core-namespace-plugin-boundary
D0030  → designs/language/builtin-constructors
D0031  → designs/language/syntax-sugar
D0032  → designs/host/search-retrieval-index
D0033  → designs/language/markup-surface
D0034  → designs/language/code-grammar
D0035  → designs/host/daemon-process-views
D0036  → designs/host/client-interface-protocol
```

D0002–D0010 是拆分前的混合文档，已由上述概念文档取代；其历史全文只存在于旧提交中。
